-- תקנון שירות עובדי הוראה, פרק 6, §6.1 יחידת עבודה
-- The work unit (a full position) of a teacher in a post-primary school.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `6.1 יחידת עבודה`

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_1__hc_2/p1
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `weekly teaching hours in a post-primary work unit` IS 24

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_1__hc_2/p1
@desc The share of a full post-primary position that a number of weekly teaching hours makes.
GIVEN `weekly teaching hours` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `post-primary position fraction` `weekly teaching hours` IS
    `weekly teaching hours` DIVIDED BY `weekly teaching hours in a post-primary work unit`

-- akn:chp_6__sec_6_1__hc_3/p1 The section's source (אסמכתא): a Director-General's circular.

-- Examples: 24 hours are one full position, 12 are half of one.
#ASSERT `post-primary position fraction` 24 EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `post-primary position fraction` 12 EQUALS 0.5
